  "id": "olfactory-epithelium",
  "term": "olfactory epithelium",
  "definition": "The olfactory epithelium is the smell-related tissue in the nose. In psychiatry research, it is assessed as a possible marker of olfactory changes, disease-related biological differences, and changes in the central nervous system during treatment.",
